  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Why were there two of them? Am I being deceived from the start, or is
    this just a coincidence? Impossible... Then why did she say she wanted to get
    out? If that's the case, why did she try to trap me? I can't understand it.\n\nDamn
    it, the shadows are closing in. If anyone reads this note, it means I'm already
    gone.\n\n\n\n\n\u2014Anonymous"
