  m_text: "Four doors stand before you in this mysterious hall:\nTwo require keys,
    and two need a lever\u2019s call.\nBut choose wisely, for not all paths are as
    they seem,\nOnly one key leads to freedom, like waking from a dream.\n\nAmong
    the key-locked doors, one holds another key,\nThe other leads you nowhere, no
    help shall it be.\nAnd among the lever-locked pair, one hides a clue,\nWhile
    the other leaves you stranded, with nothing new.\n\nCan you choose the right
    door and find your way?\nDecide carefully, or you might be led astray."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79af5aa2d9f81be4080184a80363fcfc, type: 2}
