  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7da76348f51840f44b66e5c73f635a15, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 256571641}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1106751487}
  dialogueLines:
  - What does this note even mean? Everyone is... dead?
  - "Then... everyone I've met so far\u2014Elana, Alice, Mr. Jacob\u2014are they
    all... dead? But they seem so real, so alive. This can't be true, right?"
  - Please, don't let this be a lie. Calm down, Hazil. Take a deep breath and clear
    your mind.
  - The note keeper mentioned riddles being left behind. Clues hidden away... maybe
    they hold the answers I need.
  - I have to find these riddles and solve them. They might be the key to unraveling
    everything. But I need to be careful... I can't tell anyone, not even Alice.
  - I know it's harsh, but I can't risk losing any crucial information. I have to
    keep this to myself and find the truth, no matter what.
  wordSpeed: 0.05
  continueButton: {fileID: 5189554}
  playerMovement: {fileID: 302511516}
  npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
