  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The identity of the murderer is someone from within the Hayes family.
    I wanted to write down their name, to expose them, but every time I tried, the
    notes mentioning the murderer's identity were mysteriously destroyed. To preserve
    the truth, I hid the remaining notes in places the murderer would never suspect.
    Only someone clever enough to solve the riddles I've left behind will find them
    and uncover the identity of the killer.\n\nA word of caution: if you encounter
    anyone in this mansion, remember\u2014they are all dead.\n\n- Note Keeper"
