      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "In the 1970s, after the grand gathering at the Hayes Mansion ended, an
    incident occurred that no one anticipated. One by one, they met their end. It
    happened silently, without alerting the entire mansion. Yes, everyone remained
    unaware\u2014the murderer struck while they slept, exhausted from the day's events.\n\nOnly
    I, the note keeper, realized what was happening, but it was too late. Everyone
    was already gone. I tried to escape and warn the outside world, but I was blocked
    by a mysterious power that traps this place."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
